# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets control file: applies to files served
# straight from the asset store (they never reach the Worker/middleware).
# HTML and API responses get the full header set from middleware.ts.
# (nosniff is already applied by the asset layer — don't duplicate it.)

/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
